Package: campus-wifi-autologin
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Sandy Aprilando <sandyaprilando59@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: curl, util-linux, debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0
Recommends: network-manager | iw | wireless-tools
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Kenshin517/campus-wifi-autologin
Description: automatic login for the PENS campus Wi-Fi captive portal
 Logs in to the eepiswlan captive portal of Politeknik Elektronika Negeri
 Surabaya automatically, so you never have to open a browser and type your
 NetID and password again.
 .
 A systemd timer checks connectivity every two minutes and a NetworkManager
 dispatcher hook triggers an immediate check whenever a connection comes up.
 Login attempts are retried while the network is still starting, and the
 portal address is discovered from the redirect instead of being hardcoded.
